article_body_html_2: |
  <h2>4. Tolerances and testing</h2>
  <p>Line marking to ±5 mm, flatness over a 2 m straightedge, compaction to 95% Proctor. These are the numbers you can hold a contractor to at handover. Without them, "as per standard" means whatever the crew delivered on the day.</p>

  <h3>What to do with all this</h3>
  <p>Ask both contractors for the same four items in writing before you compare totals. The cheaper quote may still win — but you will know what you are giving up rather than finding out in year two.</p>

